window.GUIDE_DATA={"revision":"2026-10-22 · 13","releaseUrl":"https://github.com/1363306384/streamplay-studio/releases","siteUrl":"https://1363306384.github.io/tiktok/streamplay-guide/","order":["download","account","start","cast","camera","modes","gifts","live","sticker","group","one","solo","multi","scene","finish","help"],"nav":[["setup",["download","account","start","cast","camera","modes","gifts","live"]],["games",["sticker","group","one","solo","multi"]],["reference",["scene","finish","help"]]],"pages":{"start":{"title":{"en":"Workspace overview","zh":"软件概览"},"html":{"en":"<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">THE WORKSPACE</div><h1>Workspace overview</h1><p class=\"lead\">Get to know the main areas in Studio. Then use the contents to set up members, video and games.</p></div><h2>Get to know the workspace</h2><figure class=\"shot\"><button class=\"zoom\" data-image=\"assets/home.png\" data-caption=\"Studio workspace: scenes and games on the left, preview in the middle, LIVE Chat on the right\" aria-label=\"Enlarge: Studio workspace: scenes and games on the left, preview in the middle, LIVE Chat on the right\"><img src=\"assets/home.png\" alt=\"Studio workspace: scenes and games on the left, preview in the middle, LIVE Chat on the right\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>Studio workspace: scenes and games on the left, preview in the middle, LIVE Chat on the right</span><span></span></figcaption></figure><table class=\"simple-table\"><tbody><tr><td>Account menu</td><td>Manage Cast members and switch accounts.</td></tr><tr><td>Scene</td><td>Configure the camera, rankings, wheel and other overlays.</td></tr><tr><td>Modes</td><td>Choose and configure an interactive game.</td></tr><tr><td>Center preview</td><td>Check the camera feed. Add the separate game overlay to OBS.</td></tr><tr><td>LIVE Chat</td><td>Read chat and LIVE statistics after connecting.</td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"note\">There are three separate starts: your streaming software goes live; the top Start button connects LIVE data; Play and Start round start a game.</div>","zh":"<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">软件界面</div><h1>软件概览</h1><p class=\"lead\">先认识 Studio 的主要区域，之后按左侧目录完成成员、画面和玩法设置。</p></div><h2>先认清这几个位置</h2><figure class=\"shot\"><button class=\"zoom\" data-image=\"assets/home.png\" data-caption=\"Studio 首页：左边配置场景与玩法，中间预览，右边查看直播互动\" aria-label=\"放大：Studio 首页：左边配置场景与玩法，中间预览，右边查看直播互动\"><img src=\"assets/home.png\" alt=\"Studio 首页：左边配置场景与玩法，中间预览，右边查看直播互动\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>Studio 首页：左边配置场景与玩法，中间预览，右边查看直播互动</span><span></span></figcaption></figure><table class=\"simple-table\"><thead><tr><th>位置</th><th>用来做什么</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>右上角账号</td><td>管理 Cast 成员、切换账号。</td></tr><tr><td>Scene</td><td>设置摄像头、排行榜、转盘等画面组件。</td></tr><tr><td>Modes</td><td>选择并设置游戏玩法。</td></tr><tr><td>中间画面</td><td>检查摄像头预览。互动叠加层还需接入 OBS。</td></tr><tr><td>LIVE Chat</td><td>查看连接后的聊天与直播数据。</td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"note\"><strong>记住三个开始：</strong>直播软件负责开播；顶部 Start 连接直播数据；模式里的 Play / Start round 开始游戏。</div>"}},"download":{"title":{"en":"Download and install","zh":"下载与安装"},"html":{"en":"<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">BEFORE YOU START</div><h1>Download and install</h1><p class=\"lead\">Install the desktop app, then sign in with your Studio account.</p></div><ol class=\"steps\"><li><h3>Choose the latest stable release</h3><p><a href=\"https://github.com/1363306384/streamplay-studio/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open the official download page ↗</a>, find the release marked Latest and expand Assets.</p></li><li><h3>Choose the installer for your computer</h3><p>For Windows 64-bit, choose the x64 .exe installer. For an Apple Silicon Mac, choose the Apple Silicon / arm64 .dmg. Source code, .yml and .blockmap files are not installers.</p></li><li><h3>Install and open Studio</h3><p>On Windows, run the installer and follow its prompts. On Mac, open the DMG, drag the app into Applications, then open it from there.</p></li></ol><div class=\"note\">Release notes list Windows x64 and Apple Silicon Mac installers. For an Intel Mac, check for a compatible installer. Use the files currently offered on the download page.</div><p class=\"completion-check\"><strong>Check before continuing: </strong>Studio opens normally and shows the sign-in screen or your signed-in workspace.</p>","zh":"<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">BEFORE YOU START</div><h1>下载与安装</h1><p class=\"lead\">先安装桌面版，再登录 Studio 账号。</p></div><ol class=\"steps\"><li><h3>选择最新稳定版本</h3><p><a href=\"https://github.com/1363306384/streamplay-studio/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">打开官方下载页 ↗</a>，找到标记 Latest 的版本，展开 Assets。</p></li><li><h3>下载对应安装包</h3><p>Windows 64 位选择 x64 的 .exe 安装包；Apple Silicon Mac 选择 Apple Silicon / arm64 的 .dmg。不要下载 Source code、.yml 或 .blockmap。</p></li><li><h3>安装后打开 Studio</h3><p>Windows 双击安装程序，按提示完成。Mac 打开 DMG，将应用拖入“应用程序”，再从那里打开。</p></li></ol><div class=\"note\">发布说明提供 Windows x64 与 Apple Silicon Mac 安装包。Intel Mac 用户请先确认 Releases 是否已有兼容包。以下载页当前提供的文件为准。</div><p class=\"completion-check\"><strong>完成后检查：</strong>能正常打开 Streamplay Studio，并看到登录页或已登录的首页。</p>"}},"account":{"title":{"en":"Sign in and switch accounts","zh":"登录与切换账号"},"html":{"en":"<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">ACCOUNT</div><h1>Sign in and switch accounts</h1><p class=\"lead\">Sign in to Studio, then confirm that the top-right account is the one you will use for this LIVE.</p></div><h2>Sign in for the first time</h2><ol class=\"steps\"><li><h3>Open the sign-in screen</h3><p>Launch Studio. Enter your Studio account in ID and your password in Password, then click Sign In.</p></li><li><h3>Check the active account</h3><p>On the home screen, open the top-right account menu and check Active Profile. Signing in to Studio and connecting TikTok LIVE are separate steps.</p></li></ol><h2>Switch to another account</h2><ol class=\"steps\"><li><h3>End the current connection</h3><p>End the round and stop the game mode. If Studio is connecting to or connected to LIVE, click the top End button and wait for it to finish.</p></li><li><h3>Click Switch Account</h3><p>Open the top-right account menu and choose Switch Account to return to account selection.</p></li><li><h3>Select a saved account or add one</h3><p>Click a saved account to try signing in directly. For a new account, click Add another account and enter ID and Password. If a saved sign-in has expired, enter its password to continue.</p></li><li><h3>Check the new account setup</h3><p>Confirm Active Profile, Cast roster, selected players, gifts and the OBS overlay before reconnecting LIVE for that account.</p></li></ol><figure class=\"shot\"><button class=\"zoom\" data-image=\"assets/cast-menu-full.png\" data-caption=\"Account menu reference: Cast Settings and Switch Account are in this menu\" aria-label=\"Enlarge: Account menu reference: Cast Settings and Switch Account are in this menu\"><img src=\"assets/cast-menu-full.png\" alt=\"Account menu reference: Cast Settings and Switch Account are in this menu\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>Account menu reference: Cast Settings and Switch Account are in this menu</span><span></span></figcaption></figure><details><summary>What if sign-in fails?</summary><p>Check your ID and password. If Authentication service is unavailable appears, check the network and retry later. Contact your account administrator if it continues.</p></details><details><summary>What does Log Out do?</summary><p>Log Out in the account menu signs out of the current Studio session. To move to another account, use Switch Account.</p></details><p class=\"completion-check\"><strong>Check before continuing: </strong>Active Profile shows the account you intend to use for this LIVE.</p><figure class=\"shot\"><button class=\"zoom\" data-image=\"assets/account-picker-full.png\" data-caption=\"Switch Account opens the saved account list. Add another account opens the ID and password form.\" aria-label=\"Switch Account opens the saved account list. Add another account opens the ID and password form.\"><img src=\"assets/account-picker-full.png\" alt=\"Switch Account opens the saved account list. Add another account opens the ID and password form.\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>Switch Account opens the saved account list. Add another account opens the ID and password form.</span><span></span></figcaption></figure><p>After Log Out, the account can remain in the list, but its saved sign-in has ended and a password is required. Switch Account keeps a valid saved sign-in available for quick return. An expired sign-in still needs a password.</p>","zh":"<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">ACCOUNT</div><h1>登录与切换账号</h1><p class=\"lead\">先登录 Studio，再确认右上角显示的是本场直播使用的账号。</p></div><h2>第一次登录</h2><ol class=\"steps\"><li><h3>打开登录页</h3><p>启动 Studio。在 ID 输入你的 Studio 账号，在 Password 输入密码，点击 Sign In。</p></li><li><h3>检查当前账号</h3><p>进入首页后，点击右上角账号，核对 Active Profile。Studio 登录账号与之后连接的 TikTok LIVE 是两个环节。</p></li></ol><h2>切换到另一个账号</h2><ol class=\"steps\"><li><h3>先结束当前连接</h3><p>结束当前游戏并停止模式；如 Studio 正在连接或已连接 LIVE，先点击顶部 End，等待结束。</p></li><li><h3>点击 Switch Account</h3><p>打开右上角账号菜单，选择 Switch Account，返回账号选择页。</p></li><li><h3>选已有账号或添加账号</h3><p>点击已保存的账号可尝试直接登录。要登录新账号，点 Add another account，再填写 ID 和 Password。保存登录已过期时，输入密码后继续。</p></li><li><h3>重新检查配置</h3><p>切换后核对 Active Profile、Cast 名单、参赛成员、礼物与 OBS 画面，再重新连接该账号的 LIVE。</p></li></ol><figure class=\"shot\"><button class=\"zoom\" data-image=\"assets/cast-menu-full.png\" data-caption=\"账号菜单参考图 Cast Settings 与 Switch Account 在同一菜单中\" aria-label=\"Enlarge: 账号菜单参考图 Cast Settings 与 Switch Account 在同一菜单中\"><img src=\"assets/cast-menu-full.png\" alt=\"账号菜单参考图 Cast Settings 与 Switch Account 在同一菜单中\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>账号菜单参考图 Cast Settings 与 Switch Account 在同一菜单中</span><span></span></figcaption></figure><details><summary>登录失败怎么办？</summary><p>核对 ID 与密码。出现 Authentication service is unavailable 时，先检查网络，稍后重试；仍失败时联系账号管理员。</p></details><details><summary>Log Out 是什么？</summary><p>在账号菜单中点击 Log Out，可退出当前 Studio 登录。要改用另一个账号，通常直接使用 Switch Account 更方便。</p></details><p class=\"completion-check\"><strong>完成后检查：</strong>右上角 Active Profile 是本场直播要使用的账号。</p><figure class=\"shot\"><button class=\"zoom\" data-image=\"assets/account-picker-full.png\" data-caption=\"Switch Account 打开已保存账号列表；Add another account 打开 ID 和密码输入页。\" aria-label=\"Switch Account 打开已保存账号列表；Add another account 打开 ID 和密码输入页。\"><img src=\"assets/account-picker-full.png\" alt=\"Switch Account 打开已保存账号列表；Add another account 打开 ID 和密码输入页。\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>Switch Account 打开已保存账号列表；Add another account 打开 ID 和密码输入页。</span><span></span></figcaption></figure><p>Log Out 后，账号可能仍在列表中，但原登录已结束，再次进入需要密码。Switch Account 保留有效登录，便于快速切回；登录过期时仍需重新输入密码。</p>"}},"cast":{"title":{"en":"Add Cast members","zh":"添加 Cast 成员"},"html":{"en":"<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">FIRST SESSION</div><h1>Add Cast members</h1><p class=\"lead\">Cast members are the people who take part in your games. Create the roster first, then select participants inside each game.</p></div><h2>1 Open Cast Settings</h2><p>Open the top-right account menu. Under the active profile, click <code>Cast Settings</code>.</p><figure class=\"shot\"><button class=\"zoom\" data-image=\"assets/cast-menu-full.png\" data-caption=\"Where to add members: account menu → Cast Settings\" aria-label=\"Enlarge: Where to add members: account menu → Cast Settings\"><img src=\"assets/cast-menu-full.png\" alt=\"Where to add members: account menu → Cast Settings\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>Where to add members: account menu → Cast Settings</span><span></span></figcaption></figure><h2>2 Enter the member details</h2><figure class=\"shot\"><button class=\"zoom\" data-image=\"assets/cast-filled-full.png\" data-caption=\"Added Cast members: h_001022 has a retrieved avatar; test1 and test2 use nickname avatars\" aria-label=\"Enlarge: Added Cast members: h_001022 has a retrieved avatar; test1 and test2 use nickname avatars\"><img src=\"assets/cast-filled-full.png\" alt=\"Added Cast members: h_001022 has a retrieved avatar; test1 and test2 use nickname avatars\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>Added Cast members: h_001022 has a retrieved avatar; test1 and test2 use nickname avatars</span><span></span></figcaption></figure><ol class=\"steps\"><li><h3>Enter the TikTok username</h3><p>Use TikTok @username, not the display name on the profile. The screenshot uses h_001022 for account lookup; test1 and test2 are nickname-only examples.</p></li><li><h3>Click Find</h3><p>Check the returned avatar and name. If the lookup fails, you can enter Cast Nickname manually before adding.</p></li><li><h3>Enter Cast Nickname and click Add Cast</h3><p>This name appears in the game. After adding, confirm the member appears in the Cast Members list on the right.</p></li></ol><details><summary>Why can’t I edit members?</summary><p>Stop the running game mode before opening Cast Settings. Member settings may be locked while a mode is running.</p></details><p class=\"completion-check\"><strong>Check before continuing: </strong>The required members appear in Cast Members. Select the participants again inside the game you choose.</p>","zh":"<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">首次使用</div><h1>添加 Cast 成员</h1><p class=\"lead\">Cast 就是参与游戏的成员。先建立名单，之后再到每个玩法中选择谁上场。</p></div><h2>1. 找到 Cast Settings</h2><p>点击右上角账号，在当前资料（Active Profile）下打开 <code>Cast Settings</code>。</p><figure class=\"shot\"><button class=\"zoom\" data-image=\"assets/cast-menu-full.png\" data-caption=\"添加入口：右上角账号 → Cast Settings\" aria-label=\"放大：添加入口：右上角账号 → Cast Settings\"><img src=\"assets/cast-menu-full.png\" alt=\"添加入口：右上角账号 → Cast Settings\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>添加入口：右上角账号 → Cast Settings</span><span></span></figcaption></figure><h2>2. 填写成员资料</h2><figure class=\"shot\"><button class=\"zoom\" data-image=\"assets/cast-filled-full.png\" data-caption=\"添加完成后的成员名单：h_001022 已获取头像，test1、test2 使用昵称头像\" aria-label=\"放大：添加完成后的成员名单：h_001022 已获取头像，test1、test2 使用昵称头像\"><img src=\"assets/cast-filled-full.png\" alt=\"添加完成后的成员名单：h_001022 已获取头像，test1、test2 使用昵称头像\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>添加完成后的成员名单：h_001022 已获取头像，test1、test2 使用昵称头像</span><span></span></figcaption></figure><ol class=\"steps\"><li><h3>输入 TikTok 用户名</h3><p>在 TikTok @username 中填写成员的 TikTok 用户名，不要填主页显示昵称。截图用 h_001022 演示查找，test1、test2 是手动添加的昵称示例。</p></li><li><h3>点击 Find</h3><p>查找成员资料，检查头像与昵称是否正确。查找失败时，可手动填写 Cast Nickname 后添加。</p></li><li><h3>填写 Cast Nickname，点击 Add Cast</h3><p>这是该成员在游戏中使用的名字。成功后，成员应出现在右侧 Cast Members 列表中。</p></li></ol><details><summary>为什么不能添加或编辑成员？</summary><p>先停止正在运行的游戏模式，再打开 Cast Settings。运行中成员设置可能锁定。</p></details><p class=\"completion-check\"><strong>完成后检查：</strong>需要的成员都出现在 Cast Members 中；下一步还要在具体玩法中选择参赛成员。</p>"}},"camera":{"title":{"en":"Connect camera and OBS","zh":"连接摄像头与 OBS"},"html":{"en":"<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">FIRST SESSION</div><h1>Connect camera and OBS</h1><p class=\"lead\">Connect the camera feed to Studio, then add the separate interactive overlay to OBS.</p></div><h2>1 Show the camera in Studio</h2><ol class=\"steps\"><li><h3>Prepare the scene in OBS</h3><p>Set up your camera and scene, then start OBS Virtual Camera. You may also use an available physical camera.</p></li><li><h3>Select the source in Studio</h3><p>Click the gear next to Camera. In Camera Source, select OBS Virtual Camera or your camera.</p></li><li><h3>Check the center preview</h3><p>If the device is missing, click Refresh Sources. Continue when the video preview works.</p></li></ol><figure class=\"shot\"><button class=\"zoom\" data-image=\"assets/camera-full.png\" data-caption=\"Camera Settings: select a source and refresh devices if needed\" aria-label=\"Enlarge: Camera Settings: select a source and refresh devices if needed\"><img src=\"assets/camera-full.png\" alt=\"Camera Settings: select a source and refresh devices if needed\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>Camera Settings: select a source and refresh devices if needed</span><span></span></figcaption></figure><h2>2 Show game content in OBS</h2><ol class=\"steps\"><li><h3>Copy the overlay link</h3><p>Open the top-right Studio settings gear. Copy the OBS Overlay Runtime link.</p></li><li><h3>Add a Browser source in OBS</h3><p>Paste that link into an OBS Browser source. Match its dimensions to the final canvas, for example 1080 × 1920 for portrait video.</p></li><li><h3>Place it above the camera</h3><p>Keep the Browser source above the camera source. Start the chosen mode and check member cards, scores and timers in OBS.</p></li></ol><figure class=\"shot\"><button class=\"zoom\" data-image=\"assets/overlay-link-full.png\" data-caption=\"Studio Settings: copy the OBS Overlay Runtime link from your own app\" aria-label=\"Enlarge: Studio Settings: copy the OBS Overlay Runtime link from your own app\"><img src=\"assets/overlay-link-full.png\" alt=\"Studio Settings: copy the OBS Overlay Runtime link from your own app\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>Studio Settings: copy the OBS Overlay Runtime link from your own app</span><span></span></figcaption></figure><div class=\"note\">A localhost link works on the same computer. Copy the link from your own Studio; do not type the address from this screenshot.</div><p class=\"completion-check\"><strong>Check before continuing: </strong>The center preview shows video. When a mode runs, its members and scores appear in the OBS Browser source.</p>","zh":"<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">首次使用</div><h1>连接摄像头与 OBS</h1><p class=\"lead\">需要接好两条连接：摄像头画面进入 Studio，游戏叠加层进入 OBS。</p></div><h2>1. 让 Studio 看到摄像头</h2><ol class=\"steps\"><li><h3>在 OBS 准备画面</h3><p>选择摄像头、布置画面，再启动 OBS Virtual Camera（虚拟摄像头）。也可以使用可用的实体摄像头。</p></li><li><h3>在 Studio 选择来源</h3><p>点击左侧 Camera 旁的齿轮，在 Camera Source 选择 OBS Virtual Camera 或对应摄像头。</p></li><li><h3>检查中间预览</h3><p>找不到设备时点击 Refresh Sources。预览正常后，再继续接入互动叠加层。</p></li></ol><figure class=\"shot\"><button class=\"zoom\" data-image=\"assets/camera-full.png\" data-caption=\"Camera Settings：选择摄像头来源，必要时刷新设备\" aria-label=\"放大：Camera Settings：选择摄像头来源，必要时刷新设备\"><img src=\"assets/camera-full.png\" alt=\"Camera Settings：选择摄像头来源，必要时刷新设备\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>Camera Settings：选择摄像头来源，必要时刷新设备</span><span></span></figcaption></figure><h2>2. 让 OBS 显示互动内容</h2><ol class=\"steps\"><li><h3>复制叠加层链接</h3><p>点击 Studio 右上角设置齿轮，在 OBS Overlay Runtime 旁点击复制。</p></li><li><h3>在 OBS 添加浏览器源</h3><p>添加 Browser（浏览器）来源，粘贴刚复制的链接。尺寸与最终直播画布一致，例如竖屏 1080 × 1920。</p></li><li><h3>放在摄像头上层</h3><p>将浏览器来源放在摄像头来源上面；启动所选玩法后，检查成员卡、分数与倒计时是否正常显示。</p></li></ol><figure class=\"shot\"><button class=\"zoom\" data-image=\"assets/overlay-link-full.png\" data-caption=\"Studio Settings：复制你自己软件里的 OBS Overlay Runtime 链接\" aria-label=\"放大：Studio Settings：复制你自己软件里的 OBS Overlay Runtime 链接\"><img src=\"assets/overlay-link-full.png\" alt=\"Studio Settings：复制你自己软件里的 OBS Overlay Runtime 链接\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>Studio Settings：复制你自己软件里的 OBS Overlay Runtime 链接</span><span></span></figcaption></figure><div class=\"note\">截图中的 localhost 链接只适用于同一台电脑。<strong>请复制你自己 Studio 显示的链接</strong>，不要照抄截图地址。</div><p class=\"completion-check\"><strong>完成后检查：</strong>Studio 中间能看到画面。玩法启动后，OBS 浏览器源能显示该玩法的成员与分数。</p>"}},"modes":{"title":{"en":"Choose a game","zh":"选择一种玩法"},"html":{"en":"<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">FIRST SESSION</div><h1>Choose a game</h1><p class=\"lead\">Try Group Sticker first to learn how members and gifts match. Then explore timed rounds and queue rotation.</p></div><div class=\"mode-list\"><a class=\"mode-row\" href=\"#sticker\"><span class=\"mode-num\">01</span><div><strong>Group Sticker</strong><p>Member cards with continuous scoring</p></div><span class=\"arrow\">↗</span></a><a class=\"mode-row\" href=\"#group\"><span class=\"mode-num\">02</span><div><strong>Group PK</strong><p>Members compete together in a timed round</p></div><span class=\"arrow\">↗</span></a><a class=\"mode-row\" href=\"#one\"><span class=\"mode-num\">03</span><div><strong>1v1 PK</strong><p>Two players compete and the winner stays</p></div><span class=\"arrow\">↗</span></a><a class=\"mode-row\" href=\"#solo\"><span class=\"mode-num\">04</span><div><strong>Solo Stage</strong><p>Members take turns on a timed solo stage</p></div><span class=\"arrow\">↗</span></a><a class=\"mode-row\" href=\"#multi\"><span class=\"mode-num\">05</span><div><strong>Multi PK</strong><p>Multiple players compete with a bench queue</p></div><span class=\"arrow\">↗</span></a></div><h2>The usual sequence</h2><ol class=\"steps\"><li><h3>Choose a mode and open settings</h3><p>Click a mode card, then its settings gear. Select members, set the timer where available, and map gifts in modes with Gift Mapping. Solo Stage does not need representative gifts for members.</p></li><li><h3>Save the setup</h3><p>Click Save Settings. Open Map representative gifts from the contents if you need help.</p></li><li><h3>Start when LIVE is ready</h3><p>Confirm the broadcast is live and Studio is connected, then follow Start your first interaction to start the mode and round.</p></li></ol>","zh":"<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">首次使用</div><h1>选择一种玩法</h1><p class=\"lead\">第一次使用可以先试 Group Sticker。熟悉成员和礼物的对应关系后，再使用计时与轮换玩法。</p></div><div class=\"mode-list\"><a class=\"mode-row\" href=\"#sticker\"><span class=\"mode-num\">01</span><div><strong>Group Sticker · 成员贴纸</strong><p>每个成员一张礼物卡，持续累计分数。</p></div><span class=\"arrow\">↗</span></a><a class=\"mode-row\" href=\"#group\"><span class=\"mode-num\">02</span><div><strong>Group PK · 团体计时 PK</strong><p>多位成员同时比赛，在一段时间内比积分。</p></div><span class=\"arrow\">↗</span></a><a class=\"mode-row\" href=\"#one\"><span class=\"mode-num\">03</span><div><strong>1v1 PK · 双人擂台</strong><p>两人对战，赢家留台，下一位接着挑战。</p></div><span class=\"arrow\">↗</span></a><a class=\"mode-row\" href=\"#solo\"><span class=\"mode-num\">04</span><div><strong>Solo Stage · 单人舞台</strong><p>成员依次上场，进行个人目标或自由计时互动。</p></div><span class=\"arrow\">↗</span></a><a class=\"mode-row\" href=\"#multi\"><span class=\"mode-num\">05</span><div><strong>Multi PK · 多人轮换 PK</strong><p>多人同台，分数最低者与候场队列轮换。</p></div><span class=\"arrow\">↗</span></a></div><h2>大多数玩法都按这个顺序</h2><ol class=\"steps\"><li><h3>选择玩法并打开设置</h3><p>点击模式卡片，再点击模式旁的齿轮选择成员。有计时的玩法设置时长；有 Gift Mapping 的玩法还要配置礼物。Solo Stage 不需要成员代表礼物。</p></li><li><h3>保存设置</h3><p>点击 Save Settings。需要时打开左侧“绑定代表礼物”图解。</p></li><li><h3>准备好后再开始</h3><p>确认直播已开播且 Studio 已连接，再按“开始第一场互动”章节启动模式与本局。</p></li></ol>"}},"gifts":{"title":{"en":"Map representative gifts","zh":"绑定代表礼物"},"html":{"en":"<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">GIFT MAPPING</div><h1>Map representative gifts</h1><p class=\"lead\">In modes with Gift Mapping, select a representative gift for each member. Scoring follows the active game’s rules.</p></div><ol class=\"steps\"><li><h3>Open the game settings</h3><p>Find Gift Mapping and check the member’s name.</p></li><li><h3>Click the gift next to a member</h3><p>Search in Select Gift. Check the icon, name and point value.</p></li><li><h3>Save the completed setup</h3><p>Map all participants, including waiting members where required, then click Save Settings.</p></li></ol><figure class=\"shot\"><button class=\"zoom\" data-image=\"assets/gift-mapping-full.png\" data-caption=\"Gift Mapping: each row pairs a member with a gift\" aria-label=\"Enlarge: Gift Mapping: each row pairs a member with a gift\"><img src=\"assets/gift-mapping-full.png\" alt=\"Gift Mapping: each row pairs a member with a gift\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>Gift Mapping: each row pairs a member with a gift</span><span></span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"shot\"><button class=\"zoom\" data-image=\"assets/gift-select-full.png\" data-caption=\"Select Gift: an example search for Rose\" aria-label=\"Enlarge: Select Gift: an example search for Rose\"><img src=\"assets/gift-select-full.png\" alt=\"Select Gift: an example search for Rose\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>Select Gift: an example search for Rose</span><span></span></figcaption></figure><div class=\"note\">In Multi PK, every on-stage and bench member needs a unique representative gift. Check the mapping before going live.</div><details><summary>What happens to other gifts?</summary><p>You can enable Gifter Binding in Modes settings when needed. Once a viewer has a member binding, it provides fallback attribution for later unmatched gifts. Review gifts already marked unallocated in the LIVE log.</p></details><p class=\"completion-check\"><strong>Check before continuing: </strong>Each member matches the intended gift icon and name, and settings are saved. In Multi PK, bench members are configured too.</p>","zh":"<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">GIFT MAPPING</div><h1>绑定代表礼物</h1><p class=\"lead\">在有 Gift Mapping 的玩法中，为成员选择代表礼物。观众送出对应礼物时，系统才能按该玩法规则给成员加分。</p></div><ol class=\"steps\"><li><h3>打开玩法设置</h3><p>找到 Gift Mapping，先确认成员姓名或昵称。</p></li><li><h3>点击成员旁的礼物</h3><p>在 Select Gift 窗口搜索礼物名，并核对图标、名称和分值。</p></li><li><h3>选好后保存</h3><p>完成所有参赛成员的礼物配置，点击 Save Settings。需要轮换的玩法也要检查候场成员。</p></li></ol><figure class=\"shot\"><button class=\"zoom\" data-image=\"assets/gift-mapping-full.png\" data-caption=\"Gift Mapping：每行对应一名成员及其代表礼物\" aria-label=\"放大：Gift Mapping：每行对应一名成员及其代表礼物\"><img src=\"assets/gift-mapping-full.png\" alt=\"Gift Mapping：每行对应一名成员及其代表礼物\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>Gift Mapping：每行对应一名成员及其代表礼物</span><span></span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"shot\"><button class=\"zoom\" data-image=\"assets/gift-select-full.png\" data-caption=\"Select Gift：搜索并核对礼物；这里以 Rose 搜索为例\" aria-label=\"放大：Select Gift：搜索并核对礼物；这里以 Rose 搜索为例\"><img src=\"assets/gift-select-full.png\" alt=\"Select Gift：搜索并核对礼物；这里以 Rose 搜索为例\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>Select Gift：搜索并核对礼物；这里以 Rose 搜索为例</span><span></span></figcaption></figure><div class=\"note\">Multi PK 的上场与候场成员都需要绑定<strong>唯一代表礼物</strong>。其他玩法也应在开场前检查对应关系。</div><details><summary>观众送了其他礼物怎么办？</summary><p>可以按实际需求开启 Modes 设置里的 Gifter Binding。它用于观众归属绑定后，对后续未匹配礼物进行归属兜底。已出现的未分配礼物，请到直播记录里检查与分配。</p></details><p class=\"completion-check\"><strong>完成后检查：</strong>成员、礼物图标和名称逐一对应，设置已保存。Multi PK 的候场成员也已配置。</p>"}},"live":{"title":{"en":"Start your first interaction","zh":"开始第一场互动"},"html":{"en":"<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">FIRST SESSION</div><h1>Start your first interaction</h1><p class=\"lead\">Once members, video and game settings are ready, start in this order.</p></div><ol class=\"steps\"><li><h3>Go live in your streaming software</h3><p>Start TikTok LIVE with your streaming software and confirm the room is online.</p></li><li><h3>Click the top Start button in Studio</h3><p>Connect to the current TikTok LIVE. Check that LIVE Chat and statistics begin updating.</p></li><li><h3>Start the chosen mode</h3><p>Click ▶ Play. In timed modes, also click Start round or Start. Check the game overlay in OBS.</p></li><li><h3>Verify a real interaction</h3><p>Check the viewer, gift, assigned member and score before continuing the activity.</p></li></ol><div class=\"note\">The top Start button does not start a broadcast. It connects LIVE data. Go live in your streaming software first.</div><h2>Quick check before starting</h2><table class=\"simple-table\"><tbody><tr><td>Members</td><td>Added to Cast and selected in the game.</td></tr><tr><td>Gifts</td><td>Mapped correctly, including any waiting members.</td></tr><tr><td>Video</td><td>Camera preview works and OBS shows the game overlay.</td></tr><tr><td>LIVE</td><td>The room is live, Studio is connected and interactions arrive.</td></tr></tbody></table>","zh":"<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">首次使用</div><h1>开始第一场互动</h1><p class=\"lead\">前面的成员、画面和玩法都准备好后，按下面顺序开始。</p></div><ol class=\"steps\"><li><h3>在直播软件正式开播</h3><p>先使用你的直播软件开始 TikTok LIVE，确认直播间已上线。</p></li><li><h3>点击 Studio 顶部 Start</h3><p>连接当前 TikTok LIVE。观察右侧 LIVE Chat 与直播数据是否开始更新。</p></li><li><h3>启动所选玩法</h3><p>点击模式的 ▶ Play。计时模式再点击 Start round / Start，检查 OBS 叠加层是否显示。</p></li><li><h3>确认一次真实互动</h3><p>核对观众、礼物、归属成员与分数是否一致，再正式推进活动。</p></li></ol><div class=\"note\"><strong>顶部 Start 不会替你开播。</strong>它连接直播数据；开播仍需要在实际直播软件中完成。</div><h2>开场前快速检查</h2><table class=\"simple-table\"><tbody><tr><td>成员</td><td>已添加，并在玩法中勾选。</td></tr><tr><td>礼物</td><td>图标和成员对应正确，候场成员也已检查。</td></tr><tr><td>画面</td><td>Studio 有预览，OBS 有互动叠加层。</td></tr><tr><td>直播</td><td>平台已开播，Studio 已连接，互动数据能收到。</td></tr></tbody></table>"}},"sticker":{"title":{"en":"Group Sticker","zh":"Group Sticker"},"html":{"en":"<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">GAME MODE</div><h1>Group Sticker</h1><p class=\"lead\">Member cards with continuous scoring</p></div><h2>How it works</h2><p>Viewers send a member’s mapped gift to support that member. This mode suits ongoing interaction without timed rounds.</p><h2>Follow these steps</h2><ol class=\"steps\"><li><h3>Select members</h3><p>Open the game settings and choose the Cast members to display.</p></li><li><h3>Map their gifts</h3><p>Use Gift Mapping to choose each member’s gift, then click Save Settings.</p></li><li><h3>Start the mode</h3><p>Return to the mode panel and click ▶ Play. Check the member scores when mapped gifts arrive.</p></li></ol><p><a href=\"#gifts\">Need help choosing gifts? Open the gift mapping guide →</a></p><figure class=\"shot\"><button class=\"zoom\" data-image=\"assets/sticker-settings.png\" data-caption=\"Group Sticker settings\" aria-label=\"Enlarge: Group Sticker settings\"><img src=\"assets/sticker-settings.png\" alt=\"Group Sticker settings\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>Group Sticker settings</span><span></span></figcaption></figure><h2>Read the settings</h2><p><strong>Placement</strong> — Drag the overlay to move it; drag its corner to resize it. Reset restores the placement.</p><p><strong>Cast Selection</strong> — Select the members who will appear in this game.</p><p><strong>Gift Mapping</strong> — Click each member’s gift to choose the representative gift, then Save Settings.</p><p><strong>Play</strong> — Play starts continuous scoring. There is no separate Start round.</p><h2>How to stop</h2><p>There is no separate Start round button. Group Sticker keeps scoring after Play; stop the mode when you finish.</p><div class=\"note\">Check each member’s gift before starting so viewers can support the intended person.</div>","zh":"<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">GAME MODE</div><h1>Group Sticker · 成员贴纸</h1><p class=\"lead\">每个成员一张礼物卡，持续累计分数。</p></div><h2>怎么玩</h2><p>观众送出成员对应的礼物，为该成员加分。适合日常互动，不需要一局一局计时。</p><h2>按这个顺序操作</h2><ol class=\"steps\"><li><h3>选择成员</h3><p>打开模式设置，勾选要展示的 Cast。</p></li><li><h3>设置代表礼物</h3><p>在 Gift Mapping 中，为成员选择对应礼物，点击 Save Settings。</p></li><li><h3>开始互动</h3><p>回到模式面板，点击 ▶ Play。收到对应礼物后查看成员分数。</p></li></ol><p><a href=\"#gifts\" style=\"color:var(--pink);font-size:13px\">不会选礼物？查看礼物绑定图解 →</a></p><figure class=\"shot\"><button class=\"zoom\" data-image=\"assets/sticker-settings.png\" data-caption=\"Group Sticker 设置界面\" aria-label=\"放大：Group Sticker 设置界面\"><img src=\"assets/sticker-settings.png\" alt=\"Group Sticker 设置界面\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>Group Sticker 设置界面</span><span></span></figcaption></figure><h2>设置页怎么填</h2><p><strong>Placement</strong> — 拖动叠层调整位置，拖动角落调整大小；Reset 重置位置。</p><p><strong>Cast Selection</strong> — 勾选本玩法需要显示的成员。</p><p><strong>Gift Mapping</strong> — 点击每名成员对应的礼物，选择代表礼物，再点 Save Settings。</p><p><strong>Play</strong> — 点击 Play 后持续计分，不需要再点 Start round。</p><h2>如何结束</h2><p>这套玩法持续记分，没有单独的 Start round。需要结束时停止该模式。</p><div class=\"note\">先确认每位成员的礼物。观众要送对应礼物，才能直接给指定成员加分。</div>"}},"group":{"title":{"en":"Group PK","zh":"Group PK"},"html":{"en":"<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">GAME MODE</div><h1>Group PK</h1><p class=\"lead\">Members compete together in a timed round</p></div><h2>How it works</h2><p>Members join the same timed round. Viewers support them with mapped gifts; use the round scores to review the result.</p><h2>Follow these steps</h2><ol class=\"steps\"><li><h3>Set the round time</h3><p>Open settings, select members and enter the duration in seconds.</p></li><li><h3>Map gifts and save</h3><p>Choose representative gifts in Gift Mapping, then click Save Settings.</p></li><li><h3>Start the round</h3><p>Click ▶ Play to enter the mode, then Start round to begin the countdown.</p></li></ol><p><a href=\"#gifts\">Need help choosing gifts? Open the gift mapping guide →</a></p><figure class=\"shot\"><button class=\"zoom\" data-image=\"assets/group-pk-settings.png\" data-caption=\"Group PK settings\" aria-label=\"Enlarge: Group PK settings\"><img src=\"assets/group-pk-settings.png\" alt=\"Group PK settings\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>Group PK settings</span><span></span></figcaption></figure><h2>Read the settings</h2><p><strong>Round Timer</strong> — Set the round length in seconds.</p><p><strong>Gift Background / Opacity</strong> — Adjust the background colour and opacity behind gift icons.</p><p><strong>Cast Selection / Gift Mapping</strong> — Select members and check the gifts shown for each member.</p><p><strong>Save Settings → Play → Start round</strong> — Save the setup, open the game, then start the timed round.</p><h2>Ending the round and continuing</h2><p>The timer or End round ends the round. After an 8-second buffer, click Start round to begin another round.</p><div class=\"note\">Group PK does not automatically eliminate or replace members using Multi PK rules.</div>","zh":"<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">GAME MODE</div><h1>Group PK · 团体计时 PK</h1><p class=\"lead\">多位成员同时比赛，在一段时间内比积分。</p></div><h2>怎么玩</h2><p>成员同时参与一局比赛，观众送代表礼物支持成员，按本局得分查看结果。</p><h2>按这个顺序操作</h2><ol class=\"steps\"><li><h3>设置一局时长</h3><p>打开模式设置，选择成员并填写比赛秒数。</p></li><li><h3>绑定礼物并保存</h3><p>在 Gift Mapping 中设置成员代表礼物，点击 Save Settings。</p></li><li><h3>开始这一局</h3><p>点击 ▶ Play 进入模式，再点击 Start round 开始倒计时。</p></li></ol><p><a href=\"#gifts\" style=\"color:var(--pink);font-size:13px\">不会选礼物？查看礼物绑定图解 →</a></p><figure class=\"shot\"><button class=\"zoom\" data-image=\"assets/group-pk-settings.png\" data-caption=\"Group PK 设置界面\" aria-label=\"放大：Group PK 设置界面\"><img src=\"assets/group-pk-settings.png\" alt=\"Group PK 设置界面\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>Group PK 设置界面</span><span></span></figcaption></figure><h2>设置页怎么填</h2><p><strong>Round Timer</strong> — 设置每一轮的秒数。</p><p><strong>Gift Background / Opacity</strong> — 调整礼物图标底板颜色与透明度。</p><p><strong>Cast Selection / Gift Mapping</strong> — 勾选成员，逐一检查各成员对应的礼物。</p><p><strong>Save Settings → Play → Start round</strong> — 先保存设置，再点击 Play，最后 Start round 开始计时。</p><h2>结束后，下一局怎么走</h2><p>到时或点击 End round 结束本局。经过 8 秒缓冲后，可以点击 Start round 开始下一局。</p><div class=\"note\">Group PK 不会按 Multi PK 的规则自动淘汰或替换成员。</div>"}},"one":{"title":{"en":"1v1 PK","zh":"1v1 PK"},"html":{"en":"<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">GAME MODE</div><h1>1v1 PK</h1><p class=\"lead\">Two players compete and the winner stays</p></div><h2>How it works</h2><p>The first two queued members take the LEFT and RIGHT positions. Viewers send the gifts mapped to each member.</p><h2>Follow these steps</h2><ol class=\"steps\"><li><h3>Arrange the queue</h3><p>Select members in settings and save. Back in the mode panel, drag members in ROUND QUEUE to set the order. The first two play first.</p></li><li><h3>Set time and gifts</h3><p>Set the round duration and map each participant’s gift. Click Save Settings.</p></li><li><h3>Start the match</h3><p>Click ▶ Play, then Start round.</p></li></ol><p><a href=\"#gifts\">Need help choosing gifts? Open the gift mapping guide →</a></p><figure class=\"shot\"><button class=\"zoom\" data-image=\"assets/1v1-settings.png\" data-caption=\"1v1 PK settings\" aria-label=\"Enlarge: 1v1 PK settings\"><img src=\"assets/1v1-settings.png\" alt=\"1v1 PK settings\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>1v1 PK settings</span><span></span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"shot\"><button class=\"zoom\" data-image=\"assets/1v1-settings-bottom.png\" data-caption=\"1v1 PK settings 2 of 2: member gifts and Save Settings\" aria-label=\"1v1 PK settings 2 of 2: member gifts and Save Settings\"><img src=\"assets/1v1-settings-bottom.png\" alt=\"1v1 PK settings 2 of 2: member gifts and Save Settings\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>1v1 PK settings 2 of 2: member gifts and Save Settings</span><span></span></figcaption></figure><h2>Read the settings</h2><p><strong>Round Timer</strong> — Set each matchup’s length in seconds.</p><p><strong>Divider Style</strong> — Choose None, White or Fire for the divider.</p><p><strong>Losing Side Effect</strong> — Choose the visual effect for the losing side.</p><p><strong>Scoreboard Style</strong> — Choose Current, Prism metal or Minimal neon.</p><p><strong>Cast Selection / Creator Gift Mapping</strong> — Select participants and configure each member’s gifts. The first two in the queue play first.</p><p><strong>Save Settings → Play → Start round</strong> — Save, open the game and begin the matchup.</p><h2>Ending the round and continuing</h2><p>The winner stays on the same side. The loser moves to the end of the queue and the next waiting member enters. A tie keeps the same matchup. With only two members, there is no replacement.</p><div class=\"note\">Check the names on LEFT and RIGHT so your spoken instructions match the gift mapping.</div>","zh":"<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">GAME MODE</div><h1>1v1 PK · 双人擂台</h1><p class=\"lead\">两人对战，赢家留台，下一位接着挑战。</p></div><h2>怎么玩</h2><p>队列前两位分别进入 LEFT 和 RIGHT。观众通过成员绑定的礼物为他们加分。</p><h2>按这个顺序操作</h2><ol class=\"steps\"><li><h3>排好参赛队列</h3><p>在设置页勾选成员并保存；返回模式面板，在 ROUND QUEUE 中拖动调整顺序，前两位先出场。</p></li><li><h3>设置比赛时长和礼物</h3><p>为参赛成员绑定代表礼物，检查后点击 Save Settings。</p></li><li><h3>开始对战</h3><p>点击 ▶ Play，再点击 Start round 开始本局。</p></li></ol><p><a href=\"#gifts\" style=\"color:var(--pink);font-size:13px\">不会选礼物？查看礼物绑定图解 →</a></p><figure class=\"shot\"><button class=\"zoom\" data-image=\"assets/1v1-settings.png\" data-caption=\"1v1 PK 设置界面\" aria-label=\"放大：1v1 PK 设置界面\"><img src=\"assets/1v1-settings.png\" alt=\"1v1 PK 设置界面\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>1v1 PK 设置界面</span><span></span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"shot\"><button class=\"zoom\" data-image=\"assets/1v1-settings-bottom.png\" data-caption=\"1v1 PK 设置 2/2：各成员礼物与 Save Settings\" aria-label=\"1v1 PK 设置 2/2：各成员礼物与 Save Settings\"><img src=\"assets/1v1-settings-bottom.png\" alt=\"1v1 PK 设置 2/2：各成员礼物与 Save Settings\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>1v1 PK 设置 2/2：各成员礼物与 Save Settings</span><span></span></figcaption></figure><h2>设置页怎么填</h2><p><strong>Round Timer</strong> — 设置每次对战的时长，单位秒。</p><p><strong>Divider Style</strong> — 选择无分隔、白色分隔或火焰分隔。</p><p><strong>Losing Side Effect</strong> — 选择落后一侧的视觉效果。</p><p><strong>Scoreboard Style</strong> — 选择 Current、Prism metal 或 Minimal neon 记分板外观。</p><p><strong>Cast Selection / Creator Gift Mapping</strong> — 选择参赛成员，设置各成员礼物；队列前两名先上场。</p><p><strong>Save Settings → Play → Start round</strong> — 保存后点击 Play，再点 Start round 开始对战。</p><h2>结束后，下一局怎么走</h2><p>本局获胜者留在原来一侧，败者回到队尾，下一位候场成员上场。平局保留原对阵；只有两位成员时不会换人。</p><div class=\"note\">开始前看清 LEFT / RIGHT 对应的成员，避免口播与礼物对应关系弄反。</div>"}},"solo":{"title":{"en":"Solo Stage","zh":"Solo Stage"},"html":{"en":"<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">GAME MODE</div><h1>Solo Stage</h1><p class=\"lead\">Members take turns on a timed solo stage</p></div><h2>How it works</h2><p>One member performs at a time. Eligible support is credited to the active member. Choose Target or Freedom.</p><h2>Follow these steps</h2><ol class=\"steps\"><li><h3>Choose the format and queue</h3><p>Select Target or Freedom and arrange the member order.</p></li><li><h3>Set the time and display</h3><p>For Target, set target A below target B. Choose Original or Avatar as needed. Freedom also uses a timer.</p></li><li><h3>Start the stage</h3><p>Save settings, click ▶ Play, then Start for the active member.</p></li></ol><figure class=\"shot\"><button class=\"zoom\" data-image=\"assets/solo-settings.png\" data-caption=\"Solo Stage settings\" aria-label=\"Enlarge: Solo Stage settings\"><img src=\"assets/solo-settings.png\" alt=\"Solo Stage settings\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>Solo Stage settings</span><span></span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"shot\"><button class=\"zoom\" data-image=\"assets/solo-freedom-settings.png\" data-caption=\"Solo Stage: Freedom and Avatar settings\" aria-label=\"Solo Stage: Freedom and Avatar settings\"><img src=\"assets/solo-freedom-settings.png\" alt=\"Solo Stage: Freedom and Avatar settings\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>Solo Stage: Freedom and Avatar settings</span><span></span></figcaption></figure><h2>Read the settings</h2><p><strong>Cast Selection</strong> — Select the members who will take turns.</p><p><strong>Solo Type</strong> — Target shows target milestones; Freedom has no target milestones. Both use a timer.</p><p><strong>Overlay Style</strong> — Choose Original or Avatar.</p><p><strong>Timer / Target A / Target B</strong> — Set seconds. In Target mode, set A lower than B.</p><p><strong>Save Settings → Play → Start</strong> — Save and open the mode, then Start. After the round, Start again rotates to the next member.</p><h2>Ending the round and continuing</h2><p>When the timer ends or you end the round, the result stays visible. The next Start rotates to the next member. Reaching a target does not automatically change the member.</p><div class=\"note\">Some settings are locked during a live round. End the round before changing them.</div>","zh":"<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">GAME MODE</div><h1>Solo Stage · 单人舞台</h1><p class=\"lead\">成员依次上场，进行个人目标或自由计时互动。</p></div><h2>怎么玩</h2><p>每次由一位成员上台，收到的有效支持计入当前上台成员。可以选择 Target（目标）或 Freedom（自由）玩法。</p><h2>按这个顺序操作</h2><ol class=\"steps\"><li><h3>选择玩法和成员</h3><p>在设置中选择 Target 或 Freedom，排好成员出场顺序。</p></li><li><h3>设置时间与展示</h3><p>Target 需要设置目标，A 小于 B；按需要选择 Original / Avatar 展示。Freedom 也有倒计时。</p></li><li><h3>开始上台</h3><p>保存后点击 ▶ Play，再点击 Start，当前成员开始本轮。</p></li></ol><figure class=\"shot\"><button class=\"zoom\" data-image=\"assets/solo-settings.png\" data-caption=\"Solo Stage 设置界面\" aria-label=\"放大：Solo Stage 设置界面\"><img src=\"assets/solo-settings.png\" alt=\"Solo Stage 设置界面\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>Solo Stage 设置界面</span><span></span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"shot\"><button class=\"zoom\" data-image=\"assets/solo-freedom-settings.png\" data-caption=\"Solo Stage：Freedom 与 Avatar 设置\" aria-label=\"Solo Stage：Freedom 与 Avatar 设置\"><img src=\"assets/solo-freedom-settings.png\" alt=\"Solo Stage：Freedom 与 Avatar 设置\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>Solo Stage：Freedom 与 Avatar 设置</span><span></span></figcaption></figure><h2>设置页怎么填</h2><p><strong>Cast Selection</strong> — 选择轮流上场的成员。</p><p><strong>Solo Type</strong> — Target 显示目标分数；Freedom 不设目标分数，两者都有计时。</p><p><strong>Overlay Style</strong> — 选择 Original 或 Avatar 显示样式。</p><p><strong>Timer / Target A / Target B</strong> — 设置回合秒数；Target 模式下设置目标 A、B，且 A 小于 B。</p><p><strong>Save Settings → Play → Start</strong> — 保存并打开玩法后点击 Start；一轮结束后再次 Start，轮到下一位成员。</p><h2>结束后，下一局怎么走</h2><p>到时或手动结束后显示本轮结果。点击下一次 Start，队列才轮到下一位；达到目标不会自动换人。</p><div class=\"note\">比赛进行中，部分设置会锁定。先结束本轮，再调整。</div>"}},"multi":{"title":{"en":"Multi PK","zh":"Multi PK"},"html":{"en":"<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">GAME MODE</div><h1>Multi PK</h1><p class=\"lead\">Multiple players compete with a bench queue</p></div><h2>How it works</h2><p>Members compete together. At the end of a round, the lowest-scoring member can be replaced by the next waiting member.</p><h2>Follow these steps</h2><ol class=\"steps\"><li><h3>Set the stage and bench</h3><p>Set On-stage count from 2 to 21. Select exactly that many members in On Stage and place waiting members in Bench Queue.</p></li><li><h3>Set time and unique gifts</h3><p>Choose 10–3600 seconds. Every on-stage and bench member needs a unique representative gift. Save settings.</p></li><li><h3>Start the first round</h3><p>Click ▶ Play, then Start round.</p></li></ol><p><a href=\"#gifts\">Need help choosing gifts? Open the gift mapping guide →</a></p><figure class=\"shot\"><button class=\"zoom\" data-image=\"assets/multi-settings-top.png\" data-caption=\"Multi PK settings 1 of 2: timer, stage count, members and bench\" aria-label=\"Multi PK settings 1 of 2: timer, stage count, members and bench\"><img src=\"assets/multi-settings-top.png\" alt=\"Multi PK settings 1 of 2: timer, stage count, members and bench\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>Multi PK settings 1 of 2: timer, stage count, members and bench</span><span></span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"shot\"><button class=\"zoom\" data-image=\"assets/multi-settings.png\" data-caption=\"Multi PK settings 2 of 2: all gift mappings and Save Settings\" aria-label=\"Enlarge: Multi PK settings\"><img src=\"assets/multi-settings.png\" alt=\"Multi PK settings 2 of 2: all gift mappings and Save Settings\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>Multi PK settings 2 of 2: all gift mappings and Save Settings</span><span></span></figcaption></figure><h2>Read the settings</h2><p><strong>Round Timer / On-stage Count</strong> — Set seconds and the number of members on stage (2–21).</p><p><strong>On Stage</strong> — Select exactly the number specified by On-stage Count.</p><p><strong>Bench Queue</strong> — Select waiting members. Their queue order determines who enters next.</p><p><strong>Gift Mapping</strong> — Every on-stage and waiting member needs a different representative gift.</p><p><strong>Save Settings → Play → Start round</strong> — Save, start the mode and start a round. If the lowest scores tie, choose who leaves before Next round.</p><h2>Ending the round and continuing</h2><p>With members waiting, the lowest-scoring member leaves and joins the end of the bench queue. The next waiting member enters; everyone else stays. With no bench members, no replacement occurs.</p><div class=\"note\">If the lowest score is tied, use Choose who leaves before the next round. A tie for highest score does not add a single-player win streak.</div><figure class=\"shot\"><button class=\"zoom\" data-image=\"assets/multi-tie-controls-full.png\" data-caption=\"When the lowest score is tied, choose who leaves before continuing\" aria-label=\"Enlarge: When the lowest score is tied, choose who leaves before continuing\"><img src=\"assets/multi-tie-controls-full.png\" alt=\"When the lowest score is tied, choose who leaves before continuing\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>When the lowest score is tied, choose who leaves before continuing</span><span></span></figcaption></figure>","zh":"<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">GAME MODE</div><h1>Multi PK · 多人轮换 PK</h1><p class=\"lead\">多人同台，分数最低者与候场队列轮换。</p></div><h2>怎么玩</h2><p>多位成员一起比赛，观众送各自代表礼物支持。每局结束后，最低分成员按候场队列替换。</p><h2>按这个顺序操作</h2><ol class=\"steps\"><li><h3>设置上场与候场</h3><p>设置 On-stage count（2–21 人），On Stage 勾选人数必须与它一致，其余放入 Bench Queue。</p></li><li><h3>设置时长和礼物</h3><p>比赛时长 10–3600 秒。上场和候场成员都需要绑定各自唯一的代表礼物。保存设置。</p></li><li><h3>开始第一局</h3><p>点击 ▶ Play 进入模式，再点击 Start round。</p></li></ol><p><a href=\"#gifts\" style=\"color:var(--pink);font-size:13px\">不会选礼物？查看礼物绑定图解 →</a></p><figure class=\"shot\"><button class=\"zoom\" data-image=\"assets/multi-settings-top.png\" data-caption=\"Multi PK 设置 1/2：计时、上场人数、成员选择与替补\" aria-label=\"Multi PK 设置 1/2：计时、上场人数、成员选择与替补\"><img src=\"assets/multi-settings-top.png\" alt=\"Multi PK 设置 1/2：计时、上场人数、成员选择与替补\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>Multi PK 设置 1/2：计时、上场人数、成员选择与替补</span><span></span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"shot\"><button class=\"zoom\" data-image=\"assets/multi-settings.png\" data-caption=\"Multi PK 设置 2/2：完整礼物绑定与 Save Settings\" aria-label=\"放大：Multi PK 设置界面\"><img src=\"assets/multi-settings.png\" alt=\"Multi PK 设置 2/2：完整礼物绑定与 Save Settings\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>Multi PK 设置 2/2：完整礼物绑定与 Save Settings</span><span></span></figcaption></figure><h2>设置页怎么填</h2><p><strong>Round Timer / On-stage Count</strong> — 设置回合秒数及同时上场人数（2–21）。</p><p><strong>On Stage</strong> — 勾选上场成员，人数必须与 On-stage Count 一致。</p><p><strong>Bench Queue</strong> — 选择替补成员，队列顺序决定谁先补位。</p><p><strong>Gift Mapping</strong> — 上场成员与替补成员都要绑定各自不同的代表礼物。</p><p><strong>Save Settings → Play → Start round</strong> — 保存后启动玩法并开始回合；最低分并列时，先选离场成员再点 Next round。</p><h2>结束后，下一局怎么走</h2><p>有候场成员时，最低分成员下台并回到候场队尾，下一位候场者上场，其他成员留台。没有候场成员时不替换。</p><div class=\"note\">最低分并列时，先在 Choose who leaves 中选择离场成员，才能开始下一局。最高分并列不增加单人连胜。</div><figure class=\"shot\"><button class=\"zoom\" data-image=\"assets/multi-tie-controls-full.png\" data-caption=\"最低分并列时：先选择离场成员，再进入下一局\" aria-label=\"放大：最低分并列时：先选择离场成员，再进入下一局\"><img src=\"assets/multi-tie-controls-full.png\" alt=\"最低分并列时：先选择离场成员，再进入下一局\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>最低分并列时：先选择离场成员，再进入下一局</span><span></span></figcaption></figure>"}},"scene":{"title":{"en":"Other scene tools","zh":"其他画面工具"},"html":{"en":"<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">SCENE AND TOOLS</div><h1>Other scene tools</h1><p class=\"lead\">Finish the basic setup first, then use these tools to suit your broadcast.</p></div><div class=\"details-wrap\"><details><summary>Ranking</summary><p>Open the gear next to Ranking, choose a list and enable its display. Available configurations include member totals, top gifters and likers. Goals can show gift-sender, like and new-follower targets.</p><figure class=\"shot\"><button class=\"zoom\" data-image=\"assets/ranking-settings.png\" data-caption=\"Ranking: select game scores and Cast members to display\" aria-label=\"Ranking: select game scores and Cast members to display\"><img src=\"assets/ranking-settings.png\" alt=\"Ranking: select game scores and Cast members to display\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>Ranking: select game scores and Cast members to display</span><span></span></figcaption></figure></details><details><summary>Lucky Wheel</summary><p>Enter one option per line in Options, set the result hold time from 1 to 15 seconds, and save. Click the play button beside Lucky Wheel to spin. The result does not automatically change game scores or members.</p><figure class=\"shot\"><button class=\"zoom\" data-image=\"assets/wheel-settings.png\" data-caption=\"Lucky Wheel: one option per line and result hold time\" aria-label=\"Lucky Wheel: one option per line and result hold time\"><img src=\"assets/wheel-settings.png\" alt=\"Lucky Wheel: one option per line and result hold time\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>Lucky Wheel: one option per line and result hold time</span><span></span></figcaption></figure></details><details><summary>Menu</summary><p>Menu displays gifts alongside custom names. Open the settings gear beside Menu in Scene.</p><p>Visibility shows or hides the menu. Layout selects vertical or horizontal order. Text opacity changes label transparency. Click the gift to replace it, enter a Name, use Add Item for more entries, or × to remove an entry. Drag the preview to move or resize the menu, then Save Settings.</p><figure class=\"shot\"><button class=\"zoom\" data-image=\"assets/menu-settings.png\" data-caption=\"Menu: visibility, layout, custom names and gift selection\" aria-label=\"Menu: visibility, layout, custom names and gift selection\"><img src=\"assets/menu-settings.png\" alt=\"Menu: visibility, layout, custom names and gift selection\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>Menu: visibility, layout, custom names and gift selection</span><span></span></figcaption></figure></details><details><summary>Gifter Binding</summary><p>Enable it from Modes settings if needed. It establishes viewer-to-member attribution and provides a fallback for later unmatched gifts. Check representative gift mappings first.</p><figure class=\"shot\"><button class=\"zoom\" data-image=\"assets/gifter-binding-full.png\" data-caption=\"Modes Settings: Gifter Binding switch\" aria-label=\"Modes Settings: Gifter Binding switch\"><img src=\"assets/gifter-binding-full.png\" alt=\"Modes Settings: Gifter Binding switch\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>Modes Settings: Gifter Binding switch</span><span></span></figcaption></figure></details></div>","zh":"<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">SCENE &amp; TOOLS</div><h1>其他画面工具</h1><p class=\"lead\">这些工具用于展示和互动。先完成基础开播流程，再按你的直播内容使用。</p></div><div class=\"details-wrap\"><details><summary>Ranking · 排行榜</summary><p>点击 Ranking 旁的齿轮，选择需要的榜单并显示。可按配置查看成员累计、送礼观众与点赞观众等榜单；Goals 可展示礼物人数、点赞和新增关注相关目标。</p><figure class=\"shot\"><button class=\"zoom\" data-image=\"assets/ranking-settings.png\" data-caption=\"Ranking：选择统计的模式及需要展示的成员\" aria-label=\"Ranking：选择统计的模式及需要展示的成员\"><img src=\"assets/ranking-settings.png\" alt=\"Ranking：选择统计的模式及需要展示的成员\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>Ranking：选择统计的模式及需要展示的成员</span><span></span></figcaption></figure></details><details><summary>Lucky Wheel · 幸运转盘</summary><p>打开转盘设置，在 Options 每行填写一个选项，设置结果停留时间（1–15 秒）并保存。点击 Lucky Wheel 旁的播放按钮转动。转盘结果不会自动替你修改游戏分数或切换成员。</p><figure class=\"shot\"><button class=\"zoom\" data-image=\"assets/wheel-settings.png\" data-caption=\"Lucky Wheel：每行一个选项，设置结果停留时间\" aria-label=\"Lucky Wheel：每行一个选项，设置结果停留时间\"><img src=\"assets/wheel-settings.png\" alt=\"Lucky Wheel：每行一个选项，设置结果停留时间\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>Lucky Wheel：每行一个选项，设置结果停留时间</span><span></span></figcaption></figure></details><details><summary>Menu · 菜单</summary><p>菜单用于展示礼物与自定义名称的对应关系。打开 Scene 中 Menu 旁的齿轮设置。</p><p>Visibility 控制菜单显示或隐藏；Layout 选择纵向或横向排列；Text opacity 调整文字透明度。点击礼物图标可更换礼物，Name 填展示名称，Add Item 添加条目，× 删除条目。拖动预览调整位置和大小，最后点击 Save Settings。</p><figure class=\"shot\"><button class=\"zoom\" data-image=\"assets/menu-settings.png\" data-caption=\"Menu：显示开关、排列方向、自定义名称和礼物选择\" aria-label=\"Menu：显示开关、排列方向、自定义名称和礼物选择\"><img src=\"assets/menu-settings.png\" alt=\"Menu：显示开关、排列方向、自定义名称和礼物选择\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>Menu：显示开关、排列方向、自定义名称和礼物选择</span><span></span></figcaption></figure></details><details><summary>Gifter Binding · 观众归属</summary><p>在 Modes 的设置入口中按需要启用。用于给观众建立成员归属，并对后续未匹配礼物进行归属兜底。使用前先确认代表礼物设置，避免归属理解错误。</p><figure class=\"shot\"><button class=\"zoom\" data-image=\"assets/gifter-binding-full.png\" data-caption=\"Modes Settings：Gifter Binding 观众归属开关\" aria-label=\"Modes Settings：Gifter Binding 观众归属开关\"><img src=\"assets/gifter-binding-full.png\" alt=\"Modes Settings：Gifter Binding 观众归属开关\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>Modes Settings：Gifter Binding 观众归属开关</span><span></span></figcaption></figure></details></div>"}},"finish":{"title":{"en":"Finish and review records","zh":"结束与查看记录"},"html":{"en":"<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">WRAP UP</div><h1>Finish and review records</h1><p class=\"lead\">End the game, disconnect Studio and end the broadcast in your streaming software.</p></div><ol class=\"steps\"><li><h3>End the round and stop the mode</h3><p>In timed games, end the current round, then stop the mode.</p></li><li><h3>Click the top End button</h3><p>Disconnect Studio from the LIVE data feed.</p></li><li><h3>End the broadcast in your streaming software</h3><p>Disconnecting Studio does not close your TikTok LIVE. Confirm the broadcast has actually ended.</p></li></ol><h2>Review gifts and attribution</h2><p>Open the top record icon, <code>LIVE data and allocation audit</code>, to view the Current LIVE log or history.</p><details><summary>How do I assign an unallocated gift?</summary><p>Click Allocate on the unallocated entry, select the correct member, then use Allocate Full Gift. Check the entry first to avoid handling it twice.</p></details><details><summary>How do I correct the assigned member?</summary><p>Click the existing assigned name and use Move Full Gift to transfer the gift to the correct member. This moves existing score; do not add another copy.</p></details><details><summary>What format is the export?</summary><p>The current session export is JSON. It saves session data; it is not an Excel workbook or a backup of software settings.</p></details><p class=\"completion-check\"><strong>Check after finishing: </strong>The game has stopped, Studio is disconnected, and the broadcast has ended in your streaming software.</p>","zh":"<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">WRAP UP</div><h1>结束与查看记录</h1><p class=\"lead\">游戏结束、Studio 断开和平台下播是三个操作，按顺序完成。</p></div><ol class=\"steps\"><li><h3>结束本局并停止玩法</h3><p>计时玩法先结束当前一局，再停止模式。</p></li><li><h3>点击 Studio 顶部 End</h3><p>断开 Studio 的直播数据连接。</p></li><li><h3>回到直播软件结束直播</h3><p>Studio 断开不会替你关闭平台直播间。确认直播软件已真正下播。</p></li></ol><h2>查看礼物与分配记录</h2><p>点击顶部记录图标 <code>LIVE data and allocation audit</code>，查看 Current LIVE 日志或历史记录。</p><div class=\"details-wrap\"><details><summary>礼物没有分到成员，怎么补？</summary><p>在未分配记录中点击 Allocate，选择正确成员，再用 Allocate Full Gift 分配整笔礼物。先核对这笔记录，避免重复处理。</p></details><details><summary>礼物分错成员，怎么改？</summary><p>点击已有归属成员的名字，使用 Move Full Gift 将原有礼物转移给正确成员。这是转移已有分数，不应另加一份。</p></details><details><summary>记录导出是什么格式？</summary><p>当前会话导出为 JSON。它用于保存会话数据，不是 Excel 表格，也不是软件配置备份。</p></details></div><p class=\"completion-check\"><strong>结束后检查：</strong>游戏已停止、Studio 已断开，直播软件也已结束平台直播。</p>"}},"help":{"title":{"en":"Troubleshooting","zh":"遇到问题"},"html":{"en":"<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">HELP</div><h1>Troubleshooting</h1><p class=\"lead\">Choose the symptom that matches what you see.</p></div><div class=\"details-wrap\"><details><summary>The camera preview is black</summary><p>Check that OBS Virtual Camera is running. Refresh Camera Settings and select the device again. For a physical camera, check availability and system permission.</p></details><details><summary>Studio shows video but OBS has no game content</summary><p>Check the OBS Overlay Runtime Browser source, the link copied from your current Studio, its position above the camera, and whether you clicked Play in the game mode.</p></details><details><summary>No LIVE data after Start</summary><p>Confirm the correct TikTok LIVE room is actually online. Check Studio’s connection status and network. Studio Start does not create a broadcast.</p></details><details><summary>A gift arrived but the score did not change</summary><p>Check whether the mode and round have started, the gift mapping and the active member. Then review the original gift and unallocated entries in the LIVE log.</p></details><details><summary>A Cast member is missing from the game</summary><p>Open that game’s settings, select the member and save. In Multi PK, also check On Stage and Bench Queue.</p></details><details><summary>I can’t edit Cast or switch accounts</summary><p>End the round and stop the mode before editing members. End the current Studio LIVE connection before switching accounts.</p></details><details><summary>Multi PK will not start the next round</summary><p>Check that the round has ended. If the lowest score is tied, use Choose who leaves first.</p></details><details><summary>Solo Stage did not rotate after a target</summary><p>Reaching a target does not rotate members. End the round, then click the next Start.</p></details></div>","zh":"<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">HELP</div><h1>遇到问题</h1><p class=\"lead\">按你遇到的现象检查，一次解决一个问题。</p></div><div class=\"details-wrap\"><details><summary>中间预览黑屏或没有摄像头？</summary><p>先确认 OBS 已启动虚拟摄像头；到 Camera Settings 刷新来源并重新选择设备。若使用实体摄像头，检查设备是否可用、系统权限是否已允许。</p></details><details><summary>Studio 有画面，但 OBS 没有游戏内容？</summary><p>检查是否添加了 OBS Overlay Runtime 的浏览器源、链接是否来自当前 Studio、浏览器源是否放在摄像头上层，以及该玩法是否已点击 Play。</p></details><details><summary>点击顶部 Start 后没有直播数据？</summary><p>确认账号对应的 TikTok LIVE 已真实开播，再检查 Studio 的连接状态与网络。单独点击 Studio Start 不会创建直播间。</p></details><details><summary>收到礼物，成员分数没变？</summary><p>检查当前玩法和本局是否已开始、礼物是否绑定给正确成员、当前上场成员是谁，再到 LIVE 日志查看原始礼物与未分配记录。</p></details><details><summary>添加了 Cast，游戏里没有？</summary><p>Cast 总名单只是成员资料。进入当前玩法设置，勾选参赛成员并保存；Multi PK 还要检查 On Stage 和 Bench Queue。</p></details><details><summary>为什么不能改成员或切换账号？</summary><p>先结束当前比赛并停止模式。切换账号前还需要结束 Studio 当前 LIVE 连接，然后再操作。</p></details><details><summary>Multi PK 为什么不能开始下一局？</summary><p>先检查本局是否结束。如果最低分并列，需要先通过 Choose who leaves 选择一位离场成员。</p></details><details><summary>Solo Stage 达到目标，为什么没换人？</summary><p>达到目标不会自动换人。结束本轮后，点击下一次 Start 才轮换到下一位。</p></details></div>"}}}};
